B.Fl=new A.hb("Do I need public speaking experience?","No. We welcome people who are just starting. You do not need to feel confident before you join \u2014 the community is how confidence grows.")
B.Fh=new A.hb("What if I'm extremely nervous?","Then you're in the right place. Nervousness is common here. We normalize it, understand it, and practice speaking through it \u2014 together.")
B.Fi=new A.hb("Do I have to speak during my first session?","We'll explain what a typical session looks like when you reach out, and you can start at a pace that feels manageable. There is no pressure to perform.")
B.Fj=new A.hb("Who can join?","Anyone who wants a supportive space to practice speaking. If you are not sure whether it is a fit, email us and we will help you decide.")
B.Fm=new A.hb("How often are sessions held?","We'll share the current schedule when you get in touch, so you have accurate dates rather than outdated information here.")
B.Fk=new A.hb("Are sessions online or in person?","We'll explain how sessions currently run when you email us, including format and what to expect on the day.")
B.Fe=new A.hb("What happens during a typical session?","Sessions focus on practice, reflection, and constructive feedback in a supportive environment. We will walk you through the flow before you join.")
B.Fg=new A.hb("How much does it cost?","Packages are listed in CAD on this page: $50 for a single session, $180 for four sessions, and $320 for eight sessions. A free online explanation session is available if you want to talk first. Email us if you have questions about which starting point is right for you.")
B.Ff=new A.hb("Can I talk to you before joining a session?","Yes. We offer a free online explanation session so you can talk with a host, understand what we do, and ask questions. There is no speaking required and no pressure to join.")
